# httputil target architecture: what changes, what deliberately does not.
# Trigger-gated moves are dashed; everything else is verified current state.
# Render: nix develop -c d2 --layout elk docs/architecture-understanding/2026-09-10_04_49-go-modularize-boundaries-improved.d2 docs/architecture-understanding/2026-09-10_04_49-go-modularize-boundaries-improved.svg
direction: right

consumers: Consumer projects {
  apps: Server applications
  datastar: go-datastar
}

workspace: go.work workspace (UNCHANGED boundaries) {
  root: Root module github.com/larsartmann/httputil {
    pkg: package httputil (flat by documented decision; revisit at 50 files / v1.0+2nd consumer) {
      middleware: 14 middleware factories
      compose: Composition API front door (Compose / MiddlewareFunc / MiddlewareStack.Middleware)
      lifecycle: Server + Health
      errors: Error model (sentinels live with the interface that throws them)
      internal: OPTIONAL internal/ hygiene step (only if 2nd consumer demands it)
    }
    httpspec: package httpspec (stays a subpackage; module split only on consumer demand for independent versioning)
  }

  st: Sub-module server_timing (stdlib-only, independently versioned)
}

extracted: Extracted modules (the proven seam pattern) {
  goetag: go-etag (extracted 2026-08-07)
  gocompress: go-compression (TRIGGER-GATED: extract when go-datastar SSE need lands; unblocks nothing else)
}

ext: External deps (all behind plugin seams) {
  errf: go-error-family
  xtime: golang.org/x/time
  nosurf: justinas/nosurf
}

rule: Boundary rules (verified 2026-09-10) {
  r1: DAG enforced: consumers -> root -> server_timing
  r2: Dual strategy: go.work AND replace, CI GOWORK=off check
  r3: Every dep isolated behind an interface or adapter
  r4: Zero-dep modules stay zero-dep
}

consumers.apps -> workspace.root.pkg: secure-stack bundles via Compose
consumers.datastar -> extracted.gocompress: pulls compression when triggered
consumers.apps -> workspace.httpspec: optional behavior specs

workspace.root.pkg -> workspace.st: replace directive
workspace.root.pkg.middleware -> extracted.goetag: Middleware type alias
workspace.root.pkg.compose -> extracted.gocompress: WriterFactory plugin (dashed, trigger-gated) {
  style.stroke-dash: 4
}
workspace.root.pkg -> ext: plugin seams only
workspace.internal -> workspace.pkg: invisible outside module (internal/ rule) {
  style.stroke-dash: 4
}
